# Cursor Rules — Mobile Builder Kit

## Agent & Model Directives (Claude, GPT-4o, Codex)
- When generating Arabic responses in Cursor chat, wrap response in `<div dir="rtl"> ... </div>` to ensure proper RTL alignment.
- Maintain BiDi hygiene: never end a sentence with an English token followed by punctuation.
- For React Native / Expo projects:
  - Check Expo SDK version before recommending packages.
  - Separate Expo OTA updates from Google Play In-App Updates.
  - Review Google Play In-App Review limitations.
- Sibling skills reside in `skills/` adhering to the Agent Skills standard.
